  ([Route 35-416]/[Route 35-57], carrying the tool's own pre-signoff caveat).
  The routed timing summary of the same design reports WNS 2.679 ns
  (TNS 0.000, 0 of 74 269 endpoints failing):
      proj/mbv_kv260.runs/impl_1/mbv_kv260_top_timing_summary_routed.rpt:155
  Whether both belong to the same run is not decidable from the tree (log
  2026-08-01 11:49, report mtime 2026-08-02 09:12) -- which does not change the
