RETRIES (tool hiccups, not results)
  Four of the eleven legs had to be repeated because Vivado could not read its
  own realtime tcl out of .Xil ("invalid argument") when a run started right
  after the previous one released it -- the hiccup scripts/p8_ooc_pair.sh
  documents. The driver now removes .Xil with the output directory and repeats
  the leg once; every repeat succeeded. Driver log: bld/p10_timing_driver.log,
  per-leg Vivado logs bld/p10_<profile>_<budget>.log (both gitignored).
